        "nobel_worthiness": "KPZ supplied a remarkably simple universal description of non-equilibrium interface fluctuations, with influence far beyond its original setting.",
        "attribution": "Kardar and Zhang introduced the defining theory; Takeuchi provided especially compelling quantitative experimental confirmation of its universality.",
        "maturity": "The universality class, its scaling laws, and its experimental realizations are now deeply established.",
        "uncertainties": [
