        "nobel_worthiness": "Their theoretical proposals established trapped ions as an exceptionally clean architecture for quantum computation and simulation.",
        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller provided seminal, clearly identifiable schemes linking controllable atomic physics to quantum information.",
        "maturity": "Trapped-ion experiments have realized many central elements and remain a leading quantum platform.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The ultimate technological route to scalable quantum computing remains unsettled."
        ]
      }
    },
