        "attribution": "Kane and Mele formulated the quantum spin Hall topological phase; Molenkamp led landmark experimental evidence.",
        "maturity": "The topological classification and characteristic boundary phenomena are firmly established.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Several experimental and theoretical contributors have comparably strong claims to limited laureate places."
        ]
      }
